Confidential-computing guests cannot serve GPU reads of pinned host memory in place
(no zero-copy UVA); with VLLM_UVA_ZERO_COPY=0 every host buffer becomes a device tensor
filled by an explicit, stream-ordered copy, with pool slots guarded by CUDA events.

